# Exact-path exemptions for scripts/check-no-active-logtalk.sh.
#
# Rules for this file (following the .hypatia-ignore precedent):
#   * exact repository-relative file paths only — no wildcards, no
#     directory blankets, no globs of any kind;
#   * every entry names a classification and a removal condition;
#   * shrink-only: adding an entry is a policy change requiring the
#     same review as adding a rule; removing one is always welcome;
#   * the guard fails if an entry points at a missing file or a file
#     that no longer contains any guarded form (stale exemption).
#
# Format: <path> | <classification> | <removal condition>
#
# Historical audit-training originals (2025-12-29). The blocks are the
# source of record against which AuditPrevention was transcribed; they
# are headed "historical … superseded" in place. Remove an entry only
# together with deleting/rewriting that file's Logtalk block.
